        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If you want to collaborate together on markdown files in realtime — rather than having one person type everything in, here’s a cool free tool: ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "href": "https://hackmd.io/",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "HackMD",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ". Just copy/paste from here into github wiki when you are done.  ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "DO",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " make sure to double check your formatting with the ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Preview",
          "styles": {
            "italic": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " feature.  Sometimes folks submit very malformed markdown somehow and it is hard to read. ",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
